# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (gitignored).
# Production secrets are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>` — never in wrangler.toml.
# Cloudflare account credentials are CI-ONLY (GitHub Actions secrets) — never on a laptop.

# --- Secrets used by the site Worker ---

# Resend API key for outbound email via mail.tunnex.io (used from S2.1).
# Local dev can use a Resend test-mode key.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...

# Cloudflare Turnstile secret key for server-side form verification (used from S2.2).
# Local dev can use the Turnstile test secret: 1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
# TURNSTILE_SECRET=0x...

# --- Optional local overrides ---

# Launch mode override (defaults to "prelaunch"):
# LAUNCH_MODE=prelaunch
